# pg_index / pg_depend / pg_sequence の参照（ユーザーオブジェクト）
query I
SELECT count(*) FROM pg_index WHERE indexrelid NOT IN (SELECT oid FROM pg_class) OR indrelid NOT IN (SELECT oid FROM pg_class)
----
0

query I
SELECT count(*) FROM pg_sequence WHERE seqrelid NOT IN (SELECT oid FROM pg_class)
----
0

query I
SELECT count(*) FROM pg_sequence WHERE seqtypid NOT IN (SELECT oid FROM pg_type)
----
0
